/scratch
*.roost/
index.db
index.db-wal
index.db-shm

# Except the one `index.db` that is evidence rather than scratch: it was written
# by `../roost-old` and this build cannot reproduce it, which is the whole point
# of it. The blanket rule above had left it untracked, and a deletion on
# 2026-09-12 took it with nothing to restore it from.
!packages/core/src/db/__fixtures__/rust-written-index/index.db

